              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 900,
              "content": "Never write a hex in a screen. If a role has no token, add the token here first — do not pick a near-match. Two colours doing the same job in two different screens is the failure this table exists to prevent. Colour means plan state and nothing else: chrome is Ink on Paper or Paper on Ink, never coloured.",
