              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Not the web app with rounder corners. iOS is here for what the platform gives for free and the browser cannot: Sign in with Apple and Face ID instead of a password, the Files picker instead of an upload field, wheel pickers instead of steppers, a push notification that reaches the contractor on a scaffold, and a camera that works offline. Same five bands, same personas, same colour rule.",
